train_input/grep1.dat:     exist at once.  1024 is arbitrary.  The idea is that the frequently
train_input/grep1.dat:     used transition tables will be quickly rebuilt, whereas the ones that
train_input/grep1.dat:     were only needed once or twice will be cleared away. */
