train_input/grep1.dat:	
train_input/grep1.dat:	STAR	ZERO		ZERO		ZERO		ZERO
train_input/grep1.dat:
train_input/grep1.dat:	QMARK	ZERO		ZERO		ZERO		ZERO
train_input/grep1.dat:
